-- The welcome warchest (item_coa_elite_warchest, PR #4943) grants/rewards these 18 items, but their item_template rows only existed in the local repack DB and were never shipped in a main SQL, so on any realm built from main Item::CreateItem() returns null for them and the warchest mail never arrives.
